      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PF Tremendous Balance\nDaily at 09:00 Madrid (PF Tremendous Balance Daily) or by hand: DM the admin when the balance is below the threshold ($500).\n\nCalled by PF Reward before every order with `{ source: order, amount, participant_name, host_name }`: returns `enough`, and DMs the admin only when the order is blocked.\n\n**Live** (production only): reads the `balance` funding source from Tremendous (credential Tremendous Production). If the balance cannot be read, no order goes out and the admin gets a DM.\n**Stub** (staging): the balance is `mockBalanceUsd` from PF Config.",
        "color": 5
      }
    },
